>> del := conn1 查询: ['DELETE FROM book WHERE id > 0'].
{  del 突变. conn1 提交. } 捕获: { :e conn1 回滚.  }, 运行.

>> insert := conn1 查询: ['INSERT INTO book (id) VALUES(null)'].
insert 突变.

>> 计数 := conn1 查询: ['SELECT COUNT(*) AS num FROM book'].
计数 获取: { :row 输出 写入: row num, 停止. }.

# does not show up
